%N A402596 a(n) = 1 if n has no p^p-factors and its least prime factor appears with multiplicity 1, otherwise 0.
%H A402596 Antti Karttunen, <a href="/A402596/b402596.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..65537</a>
%H A402596 <a href="/index/Ch#char_fns">Index entries for characteristic functions</a>.
%F A402596 a(n) = A359550(n) * (1-A319710(n)).
%F A402596 For n > 1, a(n) = A359550(n) * (1-A380534(A276085(n))).
%o A402596 (PARI) A402596(n) = if(n<2, 0, my(f = factor(n)); if(f[1,2]>1, 0, for(k=2, #f~, if(f[k,2]>=f[k,1], return(0))); (1)));
%Y A402596 Characteristic function of A402597.
%Y A402596 Cf. A276085, A319710, A359550, A380534 [= 1-a(A276086(n)), for n > 0].
%Y A402596 Cf. also A402594.
